arc42
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The arc42 documentation template is by Gernot Starke and Peter Hruschka
(https://arc42.org) and is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike
4.0 International License (CC BY-SA 4.0):

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

The module jeap-doc-template-arc42 implements the arc42 section structure so that the
documentation it generates and the documentation teams write follow it. What was changed:

  * the section names are used in English;
  * the sections are addressed by folder names carrying a number prefix and a shortened
    slug - 1-intro, 3-context-and-scope, 5-building-block-view, and so on - rather than by
    the section titles;
  * the explanatory text arc42 supplies for each section is not used. The descriptions in
    the generated documentation are written for this service.

